    "engineering transport probe runs only on the dedicated engineering branch",
    "probe assurance is NOT_REQUIRED and cannot imply T3 PASS T4 completion promotion or business certification",
    "attestation subject SHA-256 is exactly the WU01 provenance envelope identity",
